      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dynamic dislocation recovery at lower strain rates is the primary cause of the alloy's relatively low hardness and yield strength.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lower strain rates provide sufficient time for dislocations to annihilate or rearrange into lower-energy configurations.",
